!>>> FIX 6: Table 2 gives mudstone the same dry density (1800) and water
!    content (15 %) as the gravel soil, so it gets the same latent heat.
!    1267 in the -0.2..0 interval was a copy of the unfrozen value; 42466
!    makes the latent content equal to mat 1 (7.37e7 J/m3).
*IF,FIX_M4,EQ,1,THEN
mpdata,c,4,13,39562,39562,42466,42466,1272,1272
*ENDIF

